sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    participant FE as React Client
    participant API as Express API
    participant AI as FastAPI AI Service
    participant CLOUD as Cloudinary/S3
    participant DB as MongoDB

    S->>FE: Upload item photo
    FE->>CLOUD: Upload image
    CLOUD-->>FE: imageUrl
    FE->>API: POST /listings/ai-suggest {imageUrl}
    API->>AI: POST /ai/suggest-listing {imageUrl}
    alt AI service available
        AI-->>API: {category, condition, estimatedPrice}
        API-->>FE: Suggested fields (editable)
    else AI service unavailable / timeout
        AI--x API: timeout / error
        API-->>FE: fallback = manual entry (NFR-6.1)
    end
    S->>FE: Review / edit suggested fields
    FE->>API: POST /listings {title, category, condition, price, images}
    API->>DB: insert Listing (status=pending/active)
    DB-->>API: listing created
    API-->>FE: 201 Created (listing)
    FE-->>S: Listing published confirmation
